Build libalpm with the x86_64-w64-mingw32 toolchain.

Keep the port scoped to the library used by VDPM. Replace Unix-only sandbox,
scriptlet, syslog and mount probing paths on Windows; adapt the small set of
filesystem calls needed by libalpm; and use libgnurx for regex/fnmatch support.
Disk-space preflight and scriptlets remain deliberately unavailable in this
spike and must not be enabled by the Windows frontend.

Based on pacman 7.1.0 commit 5683f8477a0afcc6b331766175a83445b2dcfe89.

